  "html": "\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-background-background-color has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-jetpack-layout-grid alignfull column1-desktop-grid__span-9 column1-desktop-grid__row-1 column2-desktop-grid__span-3 column2-desktop-grid__start-10 column2-desktop-grid__row-1 column1-tablet-grid__span-5 column1-tablet-grid__row-1 column2-tablet-grid__span-3 column2-tablet-grid__start-6 column2-tablet-grid__row-1 column1-mobile-grid__span-4 column1-mobile-grid__row-1 column2-mobile-grid__span-4 column2-mobile-grid__row-2\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-jetpack-layout-grid-column wp-block-jetpack-layout-grid__padding-large\">\t<div class=\"wp-block-newspack-blocks-homepage-articles wpnbha show-image image-alignleft ts-3 is-3 is-landscape show-category  has-more-button\">\n\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t<article class=\"tag-inner-game tag-leadership tag-mindfulness tag-mindset tag-personal-growth tag-resilience tag-self-doubt tag-vulnerability category-philosophy type-post post-has-image\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"post-thumbnail\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/2026/09/09/the-stones-we-carry-how-i-freed-myself-from-self-doubt/\" rel=\"bookmark\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/life-as-sakti-6aa0caf07abcc.png\" class=\"attachment-newspack-article-block-landscape-medium size-newspack-article-block-landscape-medium wp-post-image\" alt=\"The Stones We Carry: How I Freed Myself from Self-Doubt\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cat-links \">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/category/philosophy/\">Philosophy &amp; Inner Life</a>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/2026/09/09/the-stones-we-carry-how-i-freed-myself-from-self-doubt/\" rel=\"bookmark\">The Stones We Carry: How I Freed Myself from Self-Doubt</a></h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Have I been overthinking this, or is the situation really that worrisome? Every day feels like someone has tied stones to my legs and is dragging me to the deep end of a river in a boat. The world around me is beautiful and pleasant, but I cannot enjoy it. The fear of being thrown…</p>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-meta\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-date published updated\">September 9, 2026</time>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t</article>\n\n\t\t\n\t<article class=\"category-philosophy type-post post-has-image\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"post-thumbnail\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/2026/08/30/fragments-elephant-doctor-forest-llms-and-books/\" rel=\"bookmark\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/life-as-sakti-6a93d67b456d5.png\" class=\"attachment-newspack-article-block-landscape-medium size-newspack-article-block-landscape-medium wp-post-image\" alt=\"Fragments: Elephant Doctor, Forest, LLMs and Books\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cat-links \">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/category/philosophy/\">Philosophy &amp; Inner Life</a>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/2026/08/30/fragments-elephant-doctor-forest-llms-and-books/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Fragments: Elephant Doctor, Forest, LLMs and Books</a></h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Because random thoughts need a place I am reading a book titled Stories of the True by B. Jeyamohan, the eminent Tamil author, translated from Tamil by Priyamvada. The first short story I finished is “Elephant Doctor”—about Dr. V. Krishnamurthy, a veterinary doctor in the Mudumalai Forest range. A gripping tale. What moved me was…</p>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-meta\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-date published\">August 30, 2026</time><time class=\"updated\">September 23, 2026</time>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t</article>\n\n\t\t\n\t<article class=\"category-technology type-post post-has-image\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"post-thumbnail\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/2026/08/11/introducing-odia-panjika-%e0%ac%93%e0%ac%a1%e0%ac%bc%e0%ac%bf%e0%ac%86-%e0%ac%aa%e0%ac%9e%e0%ad%8d%e0%ac%9c%e0%ac%bf%e0%ac%95%e0%ac%be-bridging-odishas-cultural-rhythm-with-modern-technolo/\" rel=\"bookmark\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/image.png\" class=\"attachment-newspack-article-block-landscape-large size-newspack-article-block-landscape-large wp-post-image\" alt=\"Introducing Odia Panjika (ଓଡ଼ିଆ ପଞ୍ଜିକା): Bridging Odisha’s Cultural Rhythm with Modern Technology\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cat-links \">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/category/technology/\">AI &amp; Technology</a>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/2026/08/11/introducing-odia-panjika-%e0%ac%93%e0%ac%a1%e0%ac%bc%e0%ac%bf%e0%ac%86-%e0%ac%aa%e0%ac%9e%e0%ad%8d%e0%ac%9c%e0%ac%bf%e0%ac%95%e0%ac%be-bridging-odishas-cultural-rhythm-with-modern-technolo/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Introducing Odia Panjika (ଓଡ଼ିଆ ପଞ୍ଜିକା): Bridging Odisha’s Cultural Rhythm with Modern Technology</a></h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>If you grew up in Odisha or belong to the global Odia diaspora, “the panji” is far more than a calendar—it is the heartbeat of cultural life. It defines when the earth rests during Raja, when fresh harvest is offered at Nuakhai, when Snana Purnima closes public darshan before the grand Rath Yatra, and when…</p>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-meta\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-date published\">August 11, 2026</time><time class=\"updated\">September 24, 2026</time>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t</article>\n\n\t\t\n\t<article class=\"tag-business tag-emotion tag-life tag-love tag-philosophy tag-thought category-corporate category-philosophy category-self-realization type-post post-has-image\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"post-thumbnail\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/2026/08/09/i-forget-that-other-people-exist/\" rel=\"bookmark\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/life-as-sakti-6a78b25c59a7f.png\" class=\"attachment-newspack-article-block-landscape-medium size-newspack-article-block-landscape-medium wp-post-image\" alt=\"I Forget That Other People Exist\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cat-links \">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/category/leadership-2/corporate/\">Corporate</a>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/2026/08/09/i-forget-that-other-people-exist/\" rel=\"bookmark\">I Forget That Other People Exist</a></h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>I get so absorbed by my own tasks that the person I spoke with last week becomes a blur. This pattern has cost more than I can measure. Here is what I am doing about it.</p>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-meta\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-date published updated\">August 9, 2026</time>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t</article>\n\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"label\">\n\t\t\t\t\tLoad more posts\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"loading\"></span>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<p class=\"error\">\n\t\t\t\tSomething went wrong. Please refresh the page and/or try again.\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\n\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-jetpack-layout-grid-column wp-block-jetpack-layout-grid__padding-large\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-style-rounded\"><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/yk8a5383.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1959\" height=\"1306\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/yk8a5383-edited.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-6193\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\">About Me</h5>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Hi, I’m Sakti. I like listening, observing, and understanding human behaviors, nature in general, and the inherent rhythm. I share these through this blog.<br /><br /><a href=\"/where-technology-meets-human-insight-2.html\">More about me</a></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-social-links is-layout-flex wp-block-social-links-is-layout-flex\"><li class=\"wp-social-link wp-social-link-facebook wp-block-social-link\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sakti.bagchi/\" class=\"wp-block-social-link-anchor\"><span class=\"wp-block-social-link-label screen-reader-text\">Facebook</span></a></li>\n\n<li class=\"wp-social-link wp-social-link-twitter wp-block-social-link\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/saktibagchi\" class=\"wp-block-social-link-anchor\"><span class=\"wp-block-social-link-label screen-reader-text\">Twitter</span></a></li>\n\n<li class=\"wp-social-link wp-social-link-instagram wp-block-social-link\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/lifeassakti/\" class=\"wp-block-social-link-anchor\"><span class=\"wp-block-social-link-label screen-reader-text\">Instagram</span></a></li>\n\n<li class=\"wp-social-link wp-social-link-linkedin wp-block-social-link\"><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/saktibagchi/\" class=\"wp-block-social-link-anchor\"><span class=\"wp-block-social-link-label screen-reader-text\">LinkedIn</span></a></li>\n\n<li class=\"wp-social-link wp-social-link-youtube wp-block-social-link\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC60a5z24wVDnqTJ_vqtNcxA?view_as=subscriber\" class=\"wp-block-social-link-anchor\"><span class=\"wp-block-social-link-label screen-reader-text\">YouTube</span></a></li></ul>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Subscribe to My Blog</h5>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Get new content delivered directly to your inbox.</p>\n\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
